f-e225-430d-a262-e5d82962d231", "name": "prompt", "type": "string", "value": "=Time Code: 00:00-00:10\nCamera Move: Static close-up shot of a man's upper body.\nScene: Outdoor setting on a pathway or street with blurred green trees and foliage under an overcast sky.\nCharacters: A muscular man with short dark hair, wearing a black and red beanie with a white 49ers logo, and a light grey t-shirt with a blue and yellow circular logo and text, and a small black microphone clipped to his shirt.\nActions: Speaking directly to the camera, gesturing with both hands, making a point with his right index finger, and moving his hands closer and further from his body., His expression is serious and determined while speaking.\n\n---\n\nTime Code: 00:10-00:20\nCamera Move: Static close-up shot of a man's upper body.\nScene: Outdoor setting on a pathway or street with blurred green trees and foliage under an overcast sky.\nCharacters: A muscular man with short dark hair, wearing a black and red beanie with a white 49ers logo, and a light grey t-shirt with a blue and yellow circular logo and text, and a small black microphone clipped to his shirt.\nActions: Speaking directly to the camera, making a pointing gesture with his right hand and then moving both hands in front of him., His expression is serious and determined while speaking.\n\n---\n\nTime Code: 00:20-00:30\nCamera Move: Static close-up shot of a man's upper body.\nScene: Outdoor setting on a pathway or street with blurred green trees and foliage under an overcast sky.\nCharacters: A muscular man with short dark hair, wearing a black and red beanie with a white 49ers logo, and a light grey t-shirt with a blue and yellow circular logo and text, and a small black microphone clipped to his shirt.\nActions: Speaking directly to the camera, making emphatic gestures with his hands, pointing with his right index finger, and then moving both hands as he speaks., His expression is serious and determined while speaking.\n\n---\n\nTime Code: 00:30-00:40\nCamera Move: Static close-up shot of a man's upper body.\nScene: Outdoor setting on a pathway or street with blurred green trees and foliage under an overcast sky.\nCharacters: A muscular man with short dark hair, wearing a black and red beanie with a white 49ers logo, and a light grey t-shirt with a blue and yellow circular logo and text, and a small black microphone clipped to his shirt.\nActions: Speaking directly to the camera, continuing to gesture emphatically with his hands, pointing his index finger, and making an open-hand gesture., His expression is serious and determined while speaking.\n\n---\n\nTime Code: 00:40-00:43\nCamera Move: Static close-up shot of a man's upper body.\nScene: Outdoor setting on a pathway or street with blurred green trees and foliage under an overcast sky.\nCharacters: A muscular man with short dark hair, wearing a black and red beanie with a white 49ers logo, and a light grey t-shirt with a blue and yellow circular logo and text, and a small black microphone clipped to his shirt.\nActions: Speaking directly to the camera, gesturing with his right hand, and ending with a slight smile., His expression is serious, transitioning to a slight smile."}, {"id": "083ce6d6-8cd2-4f73-8edd-eecd98002b1c", "name": "model", "type": "string", "value": "=sora-2"}, {"id": "9d513c9a-a150-42d8-8243-0ba08c9d3093", "name": "size", "type": "string", "value": "=1080x1920"}, {"id": "aa4fa43a-85f5-400b-9b2b-0d0de6590d39", "name": "seconds", "type": "string", "value": "=30"}, {"id": "37dda007-5c1c-4b75-89e0-5e2c1cec2b7b", "name": "token", "value": "REDACTED_openai_key", "type": "string"}]}, "includeOtherFields": true, "options": {}}, "id": "e850e99e-5239-4fdd-92f6-07c2dc430972", "name": "Settings", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set", "position": [480, 656], "typeVersion": 3.4}, {"parameters": {"content": "### Settings\n* Model: sora-2 or sora-2-pro\n* Size:\n  * Sora 2: $0.1/sec\n     * Portrait: 720x1280\n     * Landscape: 1280x720\n  * S